        "original_id": "27ffbe3f-55e8-52ed-af5f-8cd6ecd614da",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lance Shilton\n- Organizations: Holy Trinity Church Adelaide\n- Places: Elsternwick, Victoria; Melbourne; Adelaide; South Australia\n- Roles: Anglican clergy\n- Topics: education; ordination; church identity; church location\n\nFacts:\n- Lance Shilton was born in late 1921 in Elsternwick, Victoria, a suburb of Melbourne.\n- Lance Shilton was educated at the University of Melbourne.\n- Lance Shilton was ordained in 1950.\n- Holy Trinity Church Adelaide was originally named Trinity Church.\n- Holy Trinity Church Adelaide is also known as Trinity City and Holy Trinity Church Adelaide.\n- Holy Trinity Church Adelaide is an evangelical Anglican church at 88 North Terrace in the city of Adelaide, South Australia.",
